WEBVTT

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:00.880
She was starring in a movie

00:05:00.921 --> 00:05:04.300
that was considered
quite controversial at the time,

00:05:04.342 --> 00:05:08.471
and as a result had been subjected
to countless insulting interviews.

00:05:08.804 --> 00:05:12.641
So by the time I got round to her,
things were tense.

00:05:12.683 --> 00:05:13.934
And to make matters worse,

00:05:13.934 --> 00:05:17.980
we had absolutely nothing in common
to fall back on,

00:05:18.022 --> 00:05:21.442
with her being
a high-profile A-list actress,

00:05:21.442 --> 00:05:23.986
and me an up-and-coming host.

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:27.323
In that moment, I knew I had two choices.

00:05:27.365 --> 00:05:29.033
One, to carry on as we were,

00:05:29.033 --> 00:05:31.577
which would have been
very uncomfortable for us both,